%% How buildSuiteFixPrompt picks its sections. No choices branch this prompt; every section always renders.
flowchart TD
    packet[/packet: Input/] --> ALWAYS
    ALWAYS["#60;YOUR JOB#62;<br>#60;WHAT TO READ#62;<br>#60;WHAT YOU MAY EDIT (absolutePathsSection, resumedRunSection)#62;<br>#60;HOW TO FIX#62;<br>#60;FORBIDDEN ACTIONS#62;"]
    ALWAYS --> RETURN["#60;WHAT YOU, THE SPAWNING AGENT, RETURNS (whatToReturnSection)#62;"]
    RETURN --> OUTPUT["#60;FAILING SUITE OUTPUT (packet.output)#62;"]
